Description: Adapt Ice 3.7 certificate handling to OpenSSL 4
 Adapt the ASN.1 accessor changes from upstream PR #5791 to Ice 3.7.10,
 including its certificate time, extension, and key identifier handling.
 Preserve const pointers returned by OpenSSL 4 while retaining compatibility
 with OpenSSL 3's read-only extension APIs that take mutable pointers.
 Use ASN1_STRING_get_length on OpenSSL 4.1, where ASN1_STRING_length is
 deprecated, and retain the older accessor on earlier OpenSSL versions.
Origin: other, https://github.com/zeroc-ice/ice/pull/5791
Bug-Debian: https://bugs.debian.org/1138403
Forwarded: no

